# The "money shot" live edit: nano searches for this exact line in
# ui/home.go (the `app` template's homePage) and replaces it whole with
# NEW_LINE, typed live, character by character, while `fugo run` is
# hot-reloading in the neighboring pane.
SEARCH_TERM='return page(t, "Home", count, fg.SizedBox(0, t.Spacing.MD), inc, fg.SizedBox(0, t.Spacing.SM), about)'
NEW_LINE='	return page(t, "Home", count, fg.SizedBox(0, t.Spacing.MD), inc, fg.SizedBox(0, t.Spacing.SM), about, fg.SizedBox(0, t.Spacing.SM), fg.Text("🔥 hot reload — zero rebuild wait").Color(t.Colors.Success))'
